  "project_id": null,
  "name": "Owner next step",
  "description": "«Nexi onboards in Core». After each getting-started step the Owner takes in Core — a member joined · a model key was set · a pack was installed — Nexi writes the next line into the Owner's own welcome chat: one sentence naming what happened, one proposing the next open step, with the card that opens the Core screen (the step and the door are this Flow's literals, the words the Guide's). Runs as the Owner who installed the pack (`run_as: flow_owner`), so `{{initiator.global_thread}}` is the Owner's chat. Once per (organization, step): each branch has its own notify node and the message key `first-minute:<organization>:<owner>:<node>` — a second member joining finds the line already there. No governance act from the thread: the door opens a screen and runs nothing.",
  "version": 1,
  "status": "published",
  "classification": "confidential",
  "template": {
    "is_template": true,
    "source_pack_uri": "nexus://core/pack/nexus-base",
    "source_template_version": "1.0.0"
  },
